 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I built a wall around my heart, I made it out of stone",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I thought that it would keep me safe, it only left me alone",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I couldn't cry, I couldn't pray, I couldn't feel the sun",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then you came knocking softly and you said, it can be undone",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will give you a new heart",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And put a new spirit within you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will remove your heart of stone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And give you a heart of flesh",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will sprinkle clean water on you, and you will be clean",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will cleanse you from all your impurities",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will put my Spirit within you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
